# power on -> language / name entry (START, A) -> title -> menu -> single player -> Sonic & Tails -> story text
# (A mashed, START) -> Route 99's hub (zone 1), standing on the grey block right of the start.
# Then up to Act 1's ring (the big "1" ring floating above the block top at about x 768, y 264) with the tag
# action: hold R 100 frames (Tails jumps into Sonic's hands), jump with R still held, let go of R in the air
# (Tails flies, carrying Sonic), tap A to flap up, then right while flapping: up the pulley shaft, over the
# boost arrows and up the wall onto the block top. Right against the step at its end, back left under the
# ring and jump into it.
# "wait -1" after a hold takes back its one released frame, so the buttons change without letting go
# (a frame without R on the ground fires the ground tag action instead). Worked out in the harness.
wait 180
hold START 4
wait 56
hold A 4
wait 56
hold START 4
wait 56
hold A 4
wait 56
hold START 4
wait 56
hold A 4
wait 56
hold START 4
wait 56
hold A 4
wait 56
hold START 4
wait 56
hold A 4
wait 56
hold START 4
wait 56
hold A 4
wait 56
